## Known external contacts

Teams often marks externals in window titles like `Chat | <Name> (External unfamiliar) | …`.
List the externals you regularly chat with so they auto-classify to a client.

- **<Full Name>** — external. Project: <client name>. <Optional note: "Teams sometimes flags as External unfamiliar — that's stale.">
- **<Full Name>** — external. Project: <client name>.

