## Active client projects

One section per client. Include every signal that would let the skill identify
"this block is for <client>" without asking you.

### <Client Name>

**Harvest client**: `<exact name as shown in Harvest>`
**Default Harvest project**: `<project code>` `<project name>`

Signals:
- `<token>` appears in URL or window title
- Edge profile `<ProfileName>` (window title ends `... - <ProfileName> - <YourName> - Microsoft Edge`)
- Dynamics 365 at `<env-url>.crm6.dynamics.com`
- ChatGPT project named `<Project Name>` (Firefox tab title `ChatGPT - <Project Name>`, URL contains `g-p-…-<slug>`)
- Azure DevOps org `<dev.azure.com/orgname>`
- SharePoint subdomains: `<subdomain>.sharepoint.com`
- VS Code workspace `<WorkspaceName>` (title ends `… - <WorkspaceName> - Visual Studio Code`)
- Local repo path `<path>\<repo>`
- Microsoft Teams team `<Team Name>`

Common activities: <free text describing what kind of work you typically do for this client>

### <Client Name 2>

…repeat the structure above for each client.

